1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,350
从一个点开始。
Start with one dot.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,680
每 10 年，它翻一倍。
Every 10 years, it doubles.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:12,150
70 年后，它是 128。
After 70 years, it's 128.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:17,080
换个做法：每年把利息取走，利率不变。
Now take the interest out every year, at the same rate.

5
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:21,250
70 年后，只有 6 出头。
Seventy years later, you have just over 6.

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,110
奇怪的地方在这里。
Here is the strange part.

7
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:27,670
最后 10 年，多出 64。
The last 10 years add 64.

8
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:33,050
等于之前所有的增长，再加上最初那个点。
That's all the growth before them, plus the dot you started with.

9
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,960
同一道坡，晚出发 10 年，
Start 10 years later, on the same slope,

10
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:39,790
终点只剩一半。
and you finish with half.

11
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:45,800
72 除以年利率，
72, divided by your yearly rate,

12
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:49,880
就是翻一倍要的年数。
tells you how many years it takes to double.
